</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry /><entry /><entry /><entry /><entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Gunggung = </m:mtext><m:mn>138</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><example id="fs-id2222880">
<exercise id="fs-id2908692"><problem id="fs-id2206322">
<para id="fs-id2939641">Gunakake notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id2482064" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka rong persegi atusan, siji batang puluhan, lan limang blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_007_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1806167">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1249764">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> persegi atusan, sing nduweni nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1348273">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> batang puluhan, sing nduweni nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id3302675">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok satuan, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
<media id="fs-id2164193" alt="Gambar ekspresi “200 + 10 + 5”. Digit 2 ing 200, digit 1 ing 10, lan digit 5 wernane abang, dene bagean liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 215. Panah nyambungake saben digit abang ing ekspresi karo digit sing cocog ing wilangan 215.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_008_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<table id="fs-id1785447" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan kanthi 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik irah-irahan ngemot Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai total. Telung larik sabanjure ngandharake 215: digit 2 ana ing panggonan atusan lan nilaine 200; digit 1 ana ing panggonan puluhan lan nilaine 10; digit 5 ana ing panggonan satuan lan nilaine 5. Larik pungkasan nuduhake asil 215."><label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Digit</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai panggonan</entry>
<entry align="center">Wilangan</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai</entry>
<entry align="right">Nilai total</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">atusan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">puluhan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">satuan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry /><entry /><entry /><entry /><entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1381620">Blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kasebut dadi model wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id835824" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1227376"><problem id="fs-id2652455">
<para id="fs-id2784412">Gunakake notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id4224006" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka siji persegi atusan, pitung batang puluhan, lan nem blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_009_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
